<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Página não encontrada - +Sport</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            background-color: #0d0d1a;
            color: #fff;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container h1 {
            font-size: 6rem;
            margin: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5b5be0, #e0398a);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .container p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin: 10px 0 30px;
        }
        .container a {
            color: #e0398a;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 2px solid #e0398a;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .container a:hover {
            background-color: #e0398a;
            color: #fff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <section class="container">
        <h1>404</h1>
        <p>Ops! A página que você procura não existe.</p>
        <a href="/">Voltar para o início</a>
    </section>
</body>
</html>